    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\dfrac{5\\sqrt[3]4}{2}$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac5{\\sqrt[3]2}&=\\frac{5\\sqrt[3]4}{\\sqrt[3]2\\times\\sqrt[3]4}\\\\\\frac5{\\sqrt[3]2}&=\\frac{5\\sqrt[3]4}{\\sqrt[3]8}\\\\\\frac5{\\sqrt[3]2}&=\\frac{5\\sqrt[3]4}{2}\\end{align*}$$",
